 "response": {
  "text": "If your budget is **₹2,000 max**, I’d prioritize these brands in India:\n\n### [Pepe Jeans Men Blue Mid Rise Straight Fit Jeans]()\n*₹1,401.65*\n\n### [Jack & Jones Clark Washed Regular Fit Jeans]()\n*₹1,749*\n\n### [Lee Men's Travis Slim Jeans]()\n*₹1,850*\n\n### [H&M Men's Denim Blue Relaxed Jeans]()\n*₹1,999*\n\n### [Wrangler Men's Slim Fit Low Rise Jeans]()\n*₹2,000*\n\n### My ranking\n\n1. **Pepe Jeans — best overall** ⭐  \n   Great choice if you want a branded pair with good styling and comfort. Pepe currently has several men's straight-fit jeans around **₹1,499–₹1,999** on its India site. [www.pepejeans.in](https://www.pepejeans.in/men/jeans?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\n2. **Jack & Jones — best for stylish fits**  \n   Excellent if you prefer slim/regular/modern cuts. Their official India site currently has jeans under ₹1,999, including a Clark Regular Fit at ₹1,624. [www.jackjones.in](https://www.jackjones.in/collections/jj-jeans-under-1999?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\n3. **Lee — best for comfort**  \n   A good pick for everyday wear, particularly if you want some stretch. Current options include Lee jeans around ₹1,850–₹1,895.\n\n4. **Wrangler — best for durability**  \n   I'd choose Wrangler if you prefer classic, sturdy-looking denim. It's normally above ₹2,000, but sale pricing can bring some pairs to your budget.\n\n5. **H&M — best for relaxed/trendy styles**  \n   Good if fashion and a relaxed silhouette matter more than traditional denim durability.\n\n**If I were spending my own ₹2,000:** I'd get **Pepe Jeans straight-fit around ₹1,499**. It's probably the best balance of brand, fit, quality and price right now. [www.pepejeans.in](https://www.pepejeans.in/ss26-denims-73?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\nIf you tell me your **height, weight, waist size, and whether you prefer slim/straight/relaxed**, I can narrow it down to **3 specific jeans under ₹2,000**.",
